<title>POLAND: BRE NOT TO PAY PLN 10 MLN IN 1989-90 TAX.</title>
<headline>BRE NOT TO PAY PLN 10 MLN IN 1989-90 TAX.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Bank Rozwoju Eksportu SA said the tax authorities had waived their claim of 10 million zlotys from the bank for money it had received from the Export Development Fund in 1989-90, BRE said in a statement.</p>
<p>The Monday statement gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
